#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Governor</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarbaw_Nighthill\" title=\"Tarbaw Nighthill\">Tarbaw Nighthill</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Greenest\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Greenest\">Inhabitants of  Greenest</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Greenest\" title=\"Category:Locations in Greenest\">Locations in  Greenest</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Greenest (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9HcmVlbmVzdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Organizations in  Greenest</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Events in Greenest (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX0dyZWVuZXN0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Events in  Greenest</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Greenest (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6Rm9vZF9hbmRfZHJpbmtfZnJvbV9HcmVlbmVzdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Food and drink from  Greenest</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Items from Greenest (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9HcmVlbmVzdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Items from  Greenest</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Greenest</b> was the only sizable town along the <a href=\"/wiki/Uldoon_Trail\" title=\"Uldoon Trail\">Uldoon Trail</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Greenfields_(Western_Heartlands)\" title=\"Greenfields (Western Heartlands)\">Greenfields</a> area of the <a href=\"/wiki/Western_Heartlands\" title=\"Western Heartlands\">Western Heartlands</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p6_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Important_Sites\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Important Sites</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Adventures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Adventures</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Board_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Board Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greenest?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The town was founded by the <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Dharva_Scatterheart\" title=\"Dharva Scatterheart\">Dharva Scatterheart</a>, a rogue who saw herself as the queen of the Greenfields. She passed away without achieving such fame, but her town prospered and grew.&#160;In the year <a href=\"/wiki/1489_DR\" title=\"1489 DR\">1489 DR</a>, Greenest was attacked by the blue dragon <a href=\"/wiki/Lennithon\" title=\"Lennithon\">Lennithon</a> and the Cult of the Dragon.<sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p6_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p6-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greenest?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cuth_Swift\" title=\"Cuth Swift\">Cuth Swift</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p8_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p8-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eadyan_Falconmoon\" title=\"Eadyan Falconmoon\">Eadyan Falconmoon</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p11_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p11-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Escobert\" title=\"Escobert\">Escobert</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p7_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p7-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Linan_Swift\" title=\"Linan Swift\">Linan Swift</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p8_5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p8-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Markguth\" title=\"Markguth\">Markguth</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p12_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p12-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tarbaw_Nighthill\" title=\"Tarbaw Nighthill\">Tarbaw Nighthill</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HotDQ-p7_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HotDQ-p7-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Important_Sites\">Important Sites</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Important Sites\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greenest?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Important Sites\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection